00 font-bold\">✔</span><span class=\"text-slate-200\">外の猛暑とは対照的な、カーテンを閉め切った涼しい部屋でふたりきりで過ごす夏の濃密な時間</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold\">✔</span><span class=\"text-slate-200\">立場を気にする初々しい態度から、愛される歓びを知って大胆に甘えてくる劇的な変化</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold\">✔</span><span class=\"text-slate-200\">ひと夏の思い出というノスタルジーと、深い愛情に満ちた情熱の交錯が胸を打つ名演</span></li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 pt-2\">\n                <a href=\"/posts/mida00535\" class=\"flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600/50 text-white font-bold rounded-xl transition text-sm gap-1.5\">\n                  <span>📖 個別詳細レビューを読む</span>\n                  <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dmida00535&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-600 to-amber-500 hover:from-rose-500 hover:to-amber-400 text-white font-extrabold rounded-xl shadow-lg transition text-sm gap-1.5\">\n                  <span>🎬 公式で無料サンプルを見る</span>\n                  <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"/></svg>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- 作品紹介カード：第5位 -->\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl space-y-6\">\n          <div c